BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ode to Joy: European CineFest San Francisco 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T220000
DTSTAMP:20261118T010020Z
UID:funcheap-1646280@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:European Union Office in San Franciscode to Joy: European Cine
 Fest San Francisco 2026\nEurope on Screen. In Dialogue. In Celebration.\nD
 iscover the best of European feel-good cinema in San Francisco! From 19–
 23 November\, the second edition of Ode to Joy: European CineFest San Fran
 cisco brings the stories\, cultures and creativity of 17 European countrie
 s to the big screen at the Delancey Street Foundation.\n\nFollowing last y
 ear’s successful inaugural festival\, which welcomed more than 1\,000 at
 tendees\, this year’s edition offers an expanded programme of uplifting\
 , entertaining and engaging European films. From comedy and family-friendl
 y stories to music\, drama and inspiring real-life journeys\, there is som
 ething for everyone to discover.\nNamed after Beethoven’s Ode to Joy\, t
 he anthem of the European Union\, the festival celebrates Europe’s diver
 sity and shared values through the universal language of cinema.\nWhether 
 you are a European film enthusiast or simply looking for something differe
 nt to enjoy in the city\, come and experience a little of Europe right her
 e in San Francisco!\nDates: 19–23 November 2026\nVenue: Delancey Street 
 Foundation\, San Francisco\nAdmission: Free\, with advance registration\nT
 ickets and full programme:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/cc/ode-to-joy-europ
 ean-cinefest-2026-4888298?utm-campaign=social&utm-content=creatorshare&utm
 -medium=discovery&utm-term=odclsxcollection&utm-source=cp&aff=escb\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/cc/ode-to-joy-european-cinefest-20
 26-4888298?utm-campaign=social&amp\;utm-content=creatorshare&amp\;utm-medi
 um=discovery&amp\;utm-term=odclsxcollection&amp\;utm-source=cp&amp\;aff=es
 cb\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/ode-joy-european-cinefest-san-francis
 co-2026/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ode-to
 -Joy-1692.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T010020Z
LOCATION:Delancey Street Foundation\, 600 The Embarcadero\, San Francisco\
 , CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/ode-joy-european-cinefest-san-francisco-2026/
END:VEVENT
