DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe Tech InteractiveBefore Kat
 niss Everdeen\, there was Haymitch Abernathy. And before the rebellion\, t
 here was a game that changed everything.\nReturn to Panem in “The Hunger
  Games: Sunrise on the Reaping\,” the thrilling new chapter in the block
 buster franchise based on Suzanne Collins’ bestselling novels. Set 24 ye
 ars before the original “The Hunger Games\,” the story follows a young
  Haymitch Abernathy as he’s thrust into the 50th Hunger Games\, also kno
 wn as the Second Quarter Quell.\nThis time\, the Capitol doubles the numbe
 r of tributes. With 48 competitors fighting to survive\, the stakes have n
 ever been higher. As Haymitch faces deadly challenges and the Capitol’s 
 ruthless control\, his story reveals the courage and defiance that helped 
 shape Panem’s future.\n\nExperience every heart-pounding moment in the I
 MAX® Dome Theater at The Tech Interactive. With IMAX with Laser technolog
 y\, crystal-clear sound\, and the largest dome screen in the Bay Area\, yo
 u’ll feel closer to the action as the world of Panem comes to life aroun
 d you.\nWhy See It at The Tech Interactive?\n– Bigger screen\, bigger st
 akes: Experience the Games on the largest dome screen in the Bay Area.\n
 – Feel every moment: IMAX with Laser delivers stunning visuals and power
 ful\, crystal-clear sound that pull you into the action.\n– Make movie n
 ight matter: Your ticket supports hands-on science and innovation experien
 ces for the next generation.\nThe Capitol is watching. The arena awaits. G
 et your...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/170721/t/ti
 ckets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/hunger-games-sunrise-reaping-imax-
 tech-interactive/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/banner
 -1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T115305Z
LOCATION:The Tech Interactive\, 201 S. Market St. San Jose\, CA 95113
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/hunger-games-sunrise-reaping-imax-tech-interac
 tive/
END:VEVENT
