 et/35449689/0817b532-614c-49b3-9b9c-7ac5f4a38348.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261126T170128Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/25/zhang-yimou-s-raise-the-red-lan
 tern-4k-restoration-tickets
