BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nuisance Bear
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T200000
DTSTAMP:20261109T222818Z
UID:dothebay-18060838@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:“Truly groundbreaking” – Werner Herzog\n\n“A David Att
 enborough doc shot by someone on shrooms.” – i-D Magazine\n\nFor thous
 ands of years\, polar bears have migrated along the shores of Hudson Bay i
 n northern Canada. Today\, that ancient rhythm collides with a human world
  of tourism\, surveillance\, and control. Nuisance Bear immerses viewers i
 n the experience of a polar bear forced to navigate tourists\, wildlife of
 ficers\, and hunters as climate change delays the freeze and pushes bears 
 closer to human settlements. When a sacred predator is branded a “nuisan
 ce\,” it becomes unclear who truly belongs in this shared landscape.\n\n
 Returning to Churchill\, Manitoba—the self-styled “Polar Bear Capital 
 of the World”—filmmakers Gabriela Osio Vanden and Jack Weisman expand 
 their award-winning short into a feature guided by an Inuit narrator whose
  perspective resists simplification. Shot with striking intimacy and scale
 \, the film observes bears that are constantly monitored\, photographed\, 
 and redirected. In tracing this uneasy coexistence\, Nuisance Bear becomes
  a meditation on how humans manage\, commodify\, and redefine wildlife—o
 verturning the conventions of the nature documentary and reframing animals
  not as spectacle\, but as active agents in a rapidly changing world.\n\nG
 rand Jury Prize for Documentary (U.S.) – 2026 Sundance Film Festival\n\n
 Best Cinematography – 2026 Woodstock Film Festival\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 28m\
 n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDirector\n\nGabriela Osio Vanden & Jack Weisman\n\nForm
 at\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nUnited St...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.
 veezi.com/purchase/22544?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: ht
 tps://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/7/nuisance-bear-tickets\nSource: DoTheBa
 y
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35406240/508b88fa-8f2f-40cd-8c13-c1c34736f0a1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T222818Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/7/nuisance-bear-tickets
END:VEVENT
