 d Coco Peru\n\nThank you for being a friend to the ultimate comedic icon\,
  Bea Arthur!\n\nJoin us at the historic Castro Theatre for an unforgettabl
 e tribute celebrating the extraordinary life\, towering talent\, and endur
 ing legacy of Bea Arthur. BeaArthur: The Documentary – “I Have Done Ev
 erything Except Porn”\, takes a deep dive into the legendary life\, razo
 r-sharp wit\, and groundbreaking career of BeaArthur\, spanning her memora
 ble roles on stage and screen.\n\nThe evening will feature a special appea
 rance by the cast of San Francisco’s favorite drag parody show\, Golden 
 Girls Live! There will also be a costume contest before the film\, so be s
 ure to come dressed in your best Golden Girls inspired outfits to win fabu
 lous prizes! Following the screening\, director Dan Watts\, will be joined
  on stage by the fabulous and legendary Miss Coco Peru for an intimate dis
 cussion about all things Bea Arthur.\n\nBea Arthur: The Documentary – 
 “I Have Done Everything Except Porn” reveals a more personal Bea Arthu
 r: intensely private yet remarkably compassionate\, wickedly funny\, fierc
 ely intelligent and deeply committed to causes she believed in. Among them
  was her longtime advocacy for the LGBTQ+ community\, a relationship that 
 made Arthu...\n\nAll Ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment & Golden Girls Liv
 e present\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/b
