DESCRIPTION:How do you follow up a heavy-hitting\, multiple Oscar-winning 
 blockbuster like OPPENHEIMER? If you're Christopher Nolan\, you tackle one
  of the most influential stories ever told.\n\nTHE ODYSSEY brings Homer's 
 ancient Greek epic to the big screen with Matt Damon as Odysseus\, a warri
 or king trying to get home after the Trojan War. What should be a straight
 forward trip turns into a decade-long odyssey filled with peril\, adventur
 e\, and one setback after another. Basically\, it's an epic story about an
  all-time terrible commute.\n\nMake no doubt about it\, this is a movie bu
 ilt for the big screen\, and Alamo Drafthouse is the place to experience i
 t.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/the-odyssey?cinemaId=0802&se
 ssionId=24011\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/11/the-odyssey
 -tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
