CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Co-presented by the Japan Society of Northern California\n\nJa
 pan’s Official Selection for Best International Feature Film at the 99th
  Academy Awards®\n\nWINNER\, BEST ACTRESS (VIRGINIE EFIRA & TAO OKAMOTO)\
 , 2026 CANNES FILM FESTIVAL\n\nFrom Academy Award–winning director Ryûs
 uke Hamaguchi (DRIVE MY CAR) comes a moving exploration of time\, memory\,
  and human connection.\n\nVirginie Efira (BENEDETTA) stars as Marie-Lou\, 
 the progressive director of a nursing home in the Parisian suburbs\, whose
  life takes an unexpected turn when she meets Mari (Tao Okamoto)\, a Japan
 ese playwright. As the two women reflect on the lives they’ve lived\, th
 ey discover new ways to understand the time that remains. Attentive to the
  tensions between idealism and pragmatism\, Hamaguchi crafts a deeply huma
 ne film about the delicate unfolding of thought\, feeling\, and connection
 .\n\n“GORGEOUS… the rarest type of film\, not merely good enough to re
 mind you what cinema can be\, but great enough to remind you what life can
  be.” — Jessica Kiang\, Variety\n\nMORE HAMAGUCHI AT NEW PEOPLE\n\nRev
 isit Ryûsuke Hamaguchi’s acclaimed ASAKO I & II on Sunday\, November 22
  at 3:15 PM.\n\nCatch a special sneak preview of ALL OF A SUDDEN at New Pe
 ople on Saturday\, December 5.\n\nRuntime\n\n3h 16m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDir
 ector\n\nRyūsuke Hamaguchi\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nFrance\, Japan\
 , Germany & Belgium\n\nLanguage\n\nFrench\, Japanese & English\n\nFirst Sh
 owing\n\nDecember 18\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nAll of a Sudden\n\n\,\n\nFeat
 ured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22663?siteTok
 en=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/1
 2/20/all-of-a-sudden-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
