UID:dothebay-18071899@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nFemale Trouble (in 35mm
 )\n\nTuesday\, December 22 | The Castro\n\n“Not on Christmas!”\n\nDust
  off your cha-cha heels and “Dawn” your gay apparel as John Waters’ 
 classic tale of crime\, filth and glamour graces the Castro Theatre screen
  in glorious 35mm! Starring the legendary Divine as Dawn Davenport\, a wom
 an on the verge who progresses from a teenage nightmare hell-bent on getti
 ng cha-cha heels for Christmas to a fame monster whose egomaniacal impulse
 s land her in hot water. Shot in Waters’ native Baltimore\, with a cast 
 drawn from his beloved troupe of regulars\, the Dreamlanders (including Mi
 nk Stole\, David Lochary\, Mary Vivian Pearce\, Edith Massey\, and Cookie 
 Mueller)\, FEMALE TROUBLE is an endlessly quotable fan favorite\, offering
  up perverse pleasures that never fail to shock and satisfy!\n\nJoin us at
  The Castro Theatre for this special holiday treat!\n\n6:00pm – Box Offi
