 y along with "We Love Shelley Winters" trivia\, prizes and a Holiday of Ho
 rrors drag show starring Ferosha Titties\, Elsa Touche\, Abortia Clinik an
 d Brandelicious.\n\nTickets here: https://tickets.greatstartheater.org/eve
 nts/greatstartheater/2536532\n\nDirector Curtis Harrington (Night Tide\, Q
 ueen of Blood\, Games\, What's The Matter With Helen?\, The Killing Kind) 
 brings this choice slice of hagsploitation to life with Winters playing a 
 reclusive actress who invites orphans to her home for Christmas as her tou
 ch on reality slips in this macabre take on the Hansel & Gretel fairytale 
 with a script from legendary Hammer Films scribe Jimmy Sangster (Horror of
  Frankenstein\, Dracula: Prince of Darkness\, The Anniversary\, The Nanny)
 .\n\nAlso starring "Oliver" himself Mark Lester\, Chloe Franks (The Uncann
 y)\, Lionel Jeffries (The Revenge of Frankenstein)\, Michael Gothard (The 
 Devils) and Ralph Richardson (The Heiress\, Fallen Idol).\n\nSponsored by 
 Sunset Connect.\n\nPoster art by David Lawrence Hawkins.\n\n$25/21+\nDJ Da
