DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\n25th Anniversary Sing-A
 long\nChicago\nfeaturing a performance by Lady Camden\nSaturday\, January 
 9 | The Castro\n\nCelebrate a quarter-century of jazz\, murder\, and show-
 stopping glamour with a special 25th Anniversary Singalong Screening of Ch
 icago\, featuring a killer\, show-stopping live opening performance by dra
 g superstar Lady Camden!\n\nA blistering commentary about fame and the len
 gths people are willing to go to attain it\, Chicago feels more relevant t
 han ever in this modern age of 24/7 nonstop social media. Join our illustr
 ious sing-along hosts\, Toby Moore and Laurie Bushman\, as they warm you u
 p to belt out classics like All That Jazz and Cell Block Tango! Celebrate 
 one of the most iconic movie musicals ever made in true Castro Theatre sty
 le!\n\nRated R\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents: 25th Anniversary Si
 ng-Along\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/ch
 icago-270109\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/9/chicago-25th-a
 nniversary-sing-along-ft-a-performance-by-lady-camden-tickets\nSource: DoT
