CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Faith Tour\nGeorge 
 Michael\nSunday\, January 17 | The Castro\n\nStep back into 1988 and witne
 ss a pop icon at the absolute height of his creative power. Assembled from
  newly rediscovered footage shot over two unforgettable nights at the Pala
 is Omnisports de Paris-Bercy\, George Michael: The Faith Tour captures the
  electrifying energy\, soul\, and charisma of Michael’s first solo headl
 ining tour as he performs timeless hits such as “”Father Figure””\
 , “”Careless Whisper””\, and “Faith””. The film opens with F
 inding Faith\, an intimate introductory short film directed by Mary McCart
 ney featuring never-before-seen archival footage.\n\nThere is no better pl
 ace to celebrate a true queer pop music legend than with hundreds of other
  fans in the heart of The Castro! Experience George Michael: The Faith Tou
 r unlike anywhere else in the world at the newly renovated Castro Theatre!
 \n\nAll Ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents: The Faith Tour\nListe
 d time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/george-michael-th
 e-faith-tour\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/17/george-michae
 l-the-faith-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
